title: A click in a file tab puts the caret of the file's editor there: what is typed lands at that place and a save writes it
folders: rust-small
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-log: tabs: .*in front: Some\(0\), .*editing: Some
expect-file: rust-small/src/util.rs :: (?s)\Apub fn double\(n: u32\) -> u32 \{\n    Xn \* 2\n\}

wait 3000
tool edit
tab open src/util.rs
wait 1000
tab click 2 5
wait 600
type X
wait 600
mark typed-in-the-tab
wait 450
tab report
key save
wait 1200
mark saved
wait 450
quit
